# {{ project_name }}

`{{ project_name }}` is a small C++ command-line application generated by
Klonker. Its entry point is [`src/main.cpp`](src/main.cpp), and the reusable
argument parser is under [`src/cli`](src/cli).

## Configure and build

From a developer command prompt with xmake and a compatible
C++{{ cpp_standard }} compiler:

```powershell
xmake f -m debug
xmake
xmake run {{ project_name | cpp_identifier }} -- --help
```

Use `xmake f -m release` before building to select a release configuration.
xmake chooses an available Windows toolchain and keeps generated build output
under its own build directory.

Run `{{ project_name }} --help` to see its options.

Klonker generated these files but does not build, update, or otherwise manage
this project. The project is yours to change independently.
